<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Dec 26.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Dec 26.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali chairs cabinet meeting on main infrastructure projects for next 10 years.</p>
<p>- President tells Prime Minister Karoui to promote administrative sector.</p>
<p>- Arabsat executive board meeting in Tunis.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Parliament adopts 1997 budgets for training and employment and public health ministries.</p>
<p>- Tunisia imports cattle from Germany.</p>
</text>
